        "date": "2026-03-31T14:34:59Z"
      },
      "message": "Introduce file picker settings and improve customization options\n\n- Added `FilePickerSettings` to support platform-specific configuration.\n- Enhanced file picker API to allow customization of dialog titles, initial directories, and other properties.\n- Introduced desktop-specific parent window handling via `ProvideFilePickerParentWindow` and `FrameWindowScope.rememberFilePickerLauncher`.\n- Refactored sample screens to showcase new functionality.\n- Updated documentation with usage examples and setup guides.",
