        "date": "2026-03-31T15:46:57Z"
      },
      "message": "Add support for parent window in file picker dialogs on desktop\n\n- Introduced `ParentWindow` wrapper to handle native window handles across platforms (Windows, macOS, Linux).\n- Added optional `parentWindow` parameter to Kotlin and JNI APIs for file picker dialog creation.\n- Updated Rust native library with `raw-window-handle` dependency to support parent window integration.\n- Enhanced Compose integration with `ComposeWindow` support for parent window handling.",
